    "text": "Newsom’s Era: When MAGA’s Megaphone Turns into a Therapy Session\nGavin Newsom is owning MAGA so hard, Fox News might need a grief hotline.\nThey’ve been crying out for days Laura Ingraham practically hosted a live grievance counseling session for JD Vance tonight. The man looked like he just got ghosted by democracy.\nMeanwhile, Newsom’s out here swatting their attacks like flies at a barbecue.\nThey don’t know how to react. They throw tantrums, he throws strategy. They hurl insults, he flips seats.\nMAGA’s used to Democrats playing defense, Newsom’s rewriting the playbook.\nThis isn’t just a moment. It’s a shift. Newsom is the face of the Democrats now and MAGA world is collapsing under the weight of its own cosplay outrage.",
